PostgreSQL: SELECT "n" FROM generate_series($1, $2) AS "n"
  values: [I64(1), I64(3)]
MySQL: SELECT `n` FROM generate_series(?, ?) AS `n`
  values: [I64(1), I64(3)]
SQLite: SELECT "n" FROM generate_series(?, ?) AS "n"
  values: [I64(1), I64(3)]
